 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Procurement of Services (22Z)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio8352a032c7cf48d0b67fbcd33ac58f5c\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio8352a032c7cf48d0b67fbcd33ac58f5c__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item contains the creation and approval of purchase orders for services. Alternatively, the process can be triggered via the creation of a purchase requisition, which is later converted to a purchase order. The service fulfillment can be steered and monitored with the service entry sheet. Afterwards, the invoicing process is triggered.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">The scope item comprises standard as well as limit items and can be conducted with different optional steps.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio8352a032c7cf48d0b67fbcd33ac58f5c__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Manage purchase requisitions</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Manage purchase orders</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Manage service entry sheets</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Manage invoices</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio8352a032c7cf48d0b67fbcd33ac58f5c__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Provide efficient and cost-effective streamlined procurement processes</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Ensure highly automated processes for the procurement of service</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Reduce manual effort greatly</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Real-time monitoring of the service fulfillment</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Monitor purchase order items with analytical list page</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>服务采购 (22Z)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio8352a032c7cf48d0b67fbcd33ac58f5c\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio8352a032c7cf48d0b67fbcd33ac58f5c__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目包含创建和审批服务采购订单。或者，可以通过创建采购申请（稍后转换为采购订单）来触发该流程。可以通过服务条目表掌握和监控服务履行。之后，触发开发票流程。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目包括标准和限制项目，可以使用不同的可选步骤执行。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio8352a032c7cf48d0b67fbcd33ac58f5c__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">管理采购申请</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">管理采购订单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">管理服务条目表</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">管理发票</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio8352a032c7cf48d0b67fbcd33ac58f5c__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">提供经济高效的简化采购流程</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">确保服务采购的高度自动化流程</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">大幅减少手动工作量</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">实时监控服务履行情况</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">使用分析列表页面监控采购订单项目</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
